    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forgotten: The Curse of Village</strong> \u2013 Unravel the village\u2019s dark secrets, survive terrifying horrors, and escape the curse before it's too late.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528270/extras/a249eecc30306b5ea7a152d6dc2f293f.avif?t=1745993403\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528270/extras/dc7f6df160cbcd6689768cda19f911f1.avif?t=1745993403\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528270/extras/a3e2a5895b174ee298ce3fc60d9b42fb.avif?t=1745993403\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forgotten: The Curse of Village</strong> \u2013 A gripping horror adventure where every shadow hides a secret, and every step brings you closer to the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Forgotten: The Curse of Village</i></strong> is a first-person horror adventure where players step into the shoes of an investigator sent to inspect strange occurrences in a remote jungle. What starts as a routine investigation quickly spirals into a terrifying nightmare, as the player is ambushed, wakes up in an unknown location, and finds themselves entangled in the dark secrets of an abandoned village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With eerie messages hinting at a malevolent force and a monster lurking in the shadows, the player must navigate a haunting world filled with supernatural threats, solve cryptic puzzles, and uncover the truth behind the village\u2019s curse before it\u2019s too late.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forgotten: The Curse of Village</strong> \u2013 Unravel the village\u2019s dark secrets, survive terrifying horrors, and escape the curse before it's too late.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528270/extras/a249eecc30306b5ea7a152d6dc2f293f.avif?t=1745993403\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528270/extras/dc7f6df160cbcd6689768cda19f911f1.avif?t=1745993403\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528270/extras/a3e2a5895b174ee298ce3fc60d9b42fb.avif?t=1745993403\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forgotten: The Curse of Village</strong> \u2013 A gripping horror adventure where every shadow hides a secret, and every step brings you closer to the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Forgotten: The Curse of Village</i></strong> is a first-person horror adventure where players step into the shoes of an investigator sent to inspect strange occurrences in a remote jungle. What starts as a routine investigation quickly spirals into a terrifying nightmare, as the player is ambushed, wakes up in an unknown location, and finds themselves entangled in the dark secrets of an abandoned village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With eerie messages hinting at a malevolent force and a monster lurking in the shadows, the player must navigate a haunting world filled with supernatural threats, solve cryptic puzzles, and uncover the truth behind the village\u2019s curse before it\u2019s too late.</p>",
    "short_description": "Forgotten: The Curse of Village is a first-person horror adventure where players explore a cursed village, solve puzzles, and evade a lurking monster. Unravel dark secrets, survive supernatural horrors, and escape before you become another lost soul. Will you uncover the truth or vanish forever?",
